&lt;p&gt;Cosmic Music: The Life, Art and Transcendence of Alice Coltrane&amp;nbsp;is the first full biography of this remarkable, groundbreaking artist, and is an elegant, deeply researched corrective to the historical&amp;mdash;and critical&amp;mdash;record. It elevates Alice Coltrane to her proper place, both alongside her husband as one of the greatest musical visionaries of the 20th century, and also as a singular artist in Western music, one who became a spiritual leader in her lifetime.&amp;nbsp; Join us for a discussion with the author Andy Beta facilitated by Dr. Michael Veal. Thursday March 5th, 2026 at 6pm.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
