&lt;p&gt;In the exploration of Medicine and Healthcare, we would be remiss to ignore the impact that it has had shaping the futures of other fields. This year, we would like to present the 2026 Spring Hilltop theme: &lt;em&gt;The Intersections of Health: Bridging Medicine, Innovation, and Society&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;as we explore within and expand beyond the borders of healthcare science.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us for a daytime conference full of inspiring speakers who share their knowledge and expertise in their respective fields and healthcare innovation activities in between. Our line up consists of&amp;nbsp;key note speaker&amp;nbsp;Peter Muennig on&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Will digital identities transform social policy and health for better or worse?&amp;rdquo; and other seasoned&amp;nbsp;experts like&amp;nbsp;Chrystelle Vilfranc for&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;The Hidden Determinants of Cancer Outcomes: Lessons From the Lab, the Community, and the System&amp;rdquo; and&amp;nbsp;Angela Aidala! Then, Hilltop resumes once more at night for an evening gala full of music, food, and excellent company!&lt;/p&gt;
